{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50865","headline":"省题诗二十一首 甸服耆旧望籍千亩 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 甸服耆旧望籍千亩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不展三推礼，如今已几年。\n郊畿春又至，父老颈空延。\n扶杖沟塍侧，倾心日月边。\n[望恩]情倍百，流目地方千。\n未覩公卿从，长愁犬马先。\n幸同黄耇意，因此愿闻天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50865.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50865","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}